Z||000000||fieroshop||08-17-2000||10:45 AM||||I am finally moving the shop to a new and bigger location. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Shop2.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Shop3.JPG"> <BR>I will be moved by the 1st of September. Some of the new equipment we are going to get shortly. 1: A new spray booth. 2: two more lifts. All this is to be able to better serve the Fiero community and also because I am so overloaded with work that at the present time I am not able to get the cars out fast enough due to the small shop. For those of you who have placed orders with me for parts please forgive me for not answering right away and also not shipping the parts out as promised due to the fact that at the present time I can't find all my parts since they are scaddered 25 miles. The new shop will be in Richmond Calif. 635 31st st. half a block from highway 580. Our new tel # will be (510)23-FIERO. I hope that for those of you that are waiting for me to ship parts that you will forgive me for the delay, I have been busy. I should and will be moved in by the end of the month.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroshop_sig_1.gif"> ||||reg||6
Z||000001||tgowens||08-17-2000||10:57 AM||||George, that is absolutely GREAT!!! i know you will love the new shop and it will certainly allow for more efficiency. And, now Fernando has his own room!!! This is great news for all of us!!<P>I'm sure those ordering parts will understand as a move of that nature does take some time.<P>But, I sure hope you don't lose that blue tool box in the move.<P>I'm looking forward to seeing the new place soon.<P>And for those who don't understand -- here is a picture of the <I>original</I> Fiero Shop!<BR>......... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/original_fiero_shop_01.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||JAMIE||08-17-2000||11:59 AM||||George,  congrats on the move - glad to see you are doing so well - just goes to show that hard work pays off.All the best.<P>Jamie||||reg||1
